N:Slovenian children's song, from the mu-tech.org WorldTrad setting (melody MIDI diffed note by note; chords from its lead sheet). Source is in D major; moved down a whole tone to C to sit on C4-G4. The source stops after the half note in the last bar; the rest completes the bar so the tune loops.
